---
layout: page.njk
title: "Music"
---
<div class="-mt-4 mb-12 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-lg text-base-content/70">
  <p>I love listening to music, and use <a class="link" href="https://roon.app/en/">Roon</a> with Qobuz and Tidal for listening. Here are some of my playlists.</p>
  <p>Playlists come straight from Roon, and each one can be downloaded as a CSV and imported into <a class="link" href="https://soundiiz.com/">Soundiiz</a>.</p>
</div>

<ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-3" aria-label="Playlists">
{% for list in allmusic %}
  <li class="card relative">
    {% if list.cover %}
    <figure class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-box bg-base-200">
      <img src="/assets/images/playlists/{{ list.source }}.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" class="size-full object-cover" eleventy:widths="448" />
    </figure>
    {% else %}
    <figure class="grid aspect-square place-items-center rounded-box bg-base-200 text-base-content/70" aria-hidden="true">
      {{ '/node_modules/lucide-static/icons/music.svg' | svgContents("size-10") | safe }}
    </figure>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="card-body gap-1 px-0 pb-0 pt-3">
      <h2 class="card-title text-base leading-snug">
        <a href="/music/{{ list.source }}/" class="link link-hover after:absolute after:inset-0">{{ list.full_name }}</a>
      </h2>
      {% if list.tag %}<p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-base-content/70">{{ list.tag }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
